\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O God of Bethel, by whose hand
\par Thy people still are fed;
\par Who through this weary pilgrimage
\par Hast all our fathers led:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Our vows, our prayers, we now present
\par Before Thy throne of grace;
\par God of our fathers, be the God
\par Of their succeeding race.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Through each perplexing path of life
\par Our wandering footsteps guide;
\par Give us each day our daily bread,
\par And raiment fit provide.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. O spread Thy covering wings around,
\par Till all our wanderings cease,
\par And at our Father's loved abode
\par Our souls arrive in peace.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Such blessings from Thy gracious hand
\par Our humble prayers implore;
\par And Thou shalt be our chosen God,
\par And portion evermore. Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

